OL,3,GNEWSAWomen to advise mayor how to make
OL,4,ALondon safer
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal authorities across London will be
OL,7,Fable to apply for a share of #15.6m,
OL,8,Fwhich is part of a wider investment of
OL,9,Fmore than #37m.
OL,11,FThe plans have been welcomed by
OL,12,FLondon's victims' commissioner, Andrea
OL,13,FSimon and women's charity Solace
OL,14,FWomen's Aid.
